Create a backend folder manually (keeps things separate from Angular).

mkdir backend && cd backend


Create a virtual environment (best practice).

python -m venv venv
source venv/bin/activate on mac   
venv\Scripts\activate on Windows


Install dependencies inside venv.

pip install django djangorestframework psycopg2 pymongo


Start Django project inside this folder.

django-admin startproject core .


(notice the . at the end → it puts Django’s files directly in backend/ instead of creating another subfolder).

Create Django App for APIs
python manage.py startapp api

Run Server
python manage.py makemigrations
python manage.py migrate
python manage.py runserver

